## Architecture

```
Voice UI (Amharic/English)
         ↓
    Query Classifier
    (transactional/howto/technical/design)
         ↓
  [If howto/technical/design]
         ↓
    RAG Retriever
    (search_knowledge_base)
         ↓
  ChromaDB Cloud
  (495 indexed chunks)
         ↓
   OpenAI Embeddings
   (text-embedding-3-small)
         ↓
  Top-K Results (default: 5)
         ↓
   Format Context
         ↓
   LLM Prompt Enhancement
   (OpenAI GPT-4 / Addis AI)
         ↓
   Context-Aware Response
```

---

## Query Classification

**Transactional:** 
- Keywords: record, ship, receive, pack, harvest, create batch
- Response: Direct execution (no RAG)

**Howto:**
- Keywords: how to, guide, step, create, register
- Response: Search guides + labs

**Technical:**
- Keywords: EPCIS, GS1, standard, blockchain, schema
- Response: Search labs + technical guides

**Design:**
- Keywords: design, architecture, farmer, governance, voice-first
- Response: Search design docs + ideas

